          "<p>TODO:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>nginx build failing</li>\n\t<li>ag-keycloak pipeline to be done</li>\n\t<li>zookeper pipeline to be done</li>\n\t<li>5 PRs needs to be merged by code owners</li>\n\t<li>deploy pipelines to be created in azure devops</li>\n</ul>\n"
