    "jira_issues": [
      {
        "key": "GE4-7023",
        "title": "Rollout change log data service to GE builds",
        "description": "<p>Based on approach at <a href=\"https://jira.germanedge.com/browse/GE4-6821\" title=\"Implement for change log data service (based on prototype)\" class=\"issue-link\" data-issue-key=\"GE4-6821\"><del>GE4-6821</del></a> the feature must be rollout to all relevant GE services (all platform services currently under development/maintenance)</p>\n\n<p>On GE service level:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>integrate Jira credentials to the azure pipelines in specific repos</li>\n\t<li>PRs mostly created at <a href=\"https://jira.germanedge.com/browse/GE4-6821\" title=\"Implement for change log data service (based on prototype)\" class=\"issue-link\" data-issue-key=\"GE4-6821\"><del>GE4-6821</del></a> and needs to approved</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>On azure-docker-build-template</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>integrate latest version of ge-build-agent including the changelog functionality</li>\n\t<li>review the step template for changelog functionality</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>On ge-build-agent</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>release new version with changelog functionality</li>\n</ul>\n"
